{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37190","headline":"长门怨 · 高蟾","name":"长门怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天上何劳万古春，君前谁是百年人。\n魂销尚媿金炉烬，思起犹惭玉辇尘。\n烟翠薄情攀不得，星茫浮艳采无因。\n可怜明镜来相向，何似恩光朝夕新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高蟾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37190.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37190","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}